<%- include('Partials/header.ejs') %>

<body>
<%- include('Partials/main_nav.ejs') %>

<div class="page-wrapper">
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <p class="section-label s2">My Work</p>
            <h1 class="section-title">Projects</h1>
            <p class="section-subtitle">
                A selection of academic and personal projects built during my time at Ontario Tech University.
            </p>
            <div class="divider"></div>

            <!-- Project 1 -->
            <div class="row g-0 align-items-stretch project-card reveal">
                <div class="col-md-5">
                    <img src="/Assets/images/Bank.png" alt="Bank Website" class="project-card-img" style="height:100%;">
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-7 project-card-body d-flex flex-column justify-content-center">
                    <span class="project-tag">Python &bull; GUI &bull; Health</span>
                    <h2>AWS Banking SQL Database</h2>
                    <p>
                        Developed and deployed a full-stack banking web application using Python, Flask, and AWS cloud services. The application implemented backend functionality for managing banking operations and user requests, with cloud infrastructure configured to support application hosting and database connectivity. This project provided hands-on experience with cloud deployment, backend development, database integration, and application infrastructure.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3">
                        <a href="https://github.com/danielabd-it/Banking_Database" target="_blank" class="btn-ghost-custom" style="font-size:0.8rem; padding:0.5rem 1rem;">
                            <i class="fa-brands fa-github fa-xs"></i> View on GitHub
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Project 2 -->
            <div class="row g-0 align-items-stretch project-card reveal" style="flex-direction:row-reverse;">
                <div class="col-md-5">
                    <img src="/Assets/images/Movie" alt="Movie Website" class="project-card-img" style="height:100%;">
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-7 project-card-body d-flex flex-column justify-content-center">
                    <span class="project-tag">Python &bull; Cryptography &bull; Security</span>
                    <h2>MongoDB Movie Review Website</h2>
                    <p>
                        Developed a full-stack movie review website using Node.js, Express, MongoDB Atlas, and EJS. The application allows users to create and manage personal movie reviews, providing a private platform for maintaining a personalized movie journal. The project provided hands-on experience with full-stack web development, server-side programming, NoSQL database integration, and cloud-hosted MongoDB.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-3">
                        <a href="https://github.com/danielabd-it/Movie-Review" target="_blank" class="btn-ghost-custom" style="font-size:0.8rem; padding:0.5rem 1rem;">
                            <i class="fa-brands fa-github fa-xs"></i> View on GitHub
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
</div>

